  "term": "sensorimotor cortex",
  "definition": "The sensorimotor cortex is a combined region of the cerebral cortex involved in both controlling movement and processing sensory information. It includes motor, somatosensory, gustatory, olfactory, auditory, and visual cortical areas.",
